<title>USA: Duff &amp; Phelps puts Aon on rating watch-down.</title>
<headline>Duff &amp; Phelps puts Aon on rating watch-down.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Duff &amp; Phelps Credit Rating Co said Friday it placed the Double A senior debt rating of Aon Corp on watch for a possible downgrade.</p>
<p>It said the action is in response to the December 11 announcement that Aon entered into a definitive agreement to acquire Alexander &amp; Alexander Services Inc and expected increases in financial leverage that would be employed to fund the deal.</p>
<p>The combined operations would greatly enhance Aon's brokerage position, nearly doubling current revenue levels, Duff &amp; Phelps said.</p>
<p>		  ((-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
</text>
